      "updated": 1765274643384,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "f(i,j) = f(i-1,j-v[i]*k)+w[i]*k   (k=0,1,2,3,...)\n\n      = Max( f(i-1,j) , f(i-1,j-v[i]) + w[i] , f(i-1,j-v[i]*2) + w[i]*2 , f(i-1,j-v[i]*3) + w[i]*3 , ... , f(i-1,j-v[i]*k) + w[i]*k , ... )",
      "fontSize": 14.866307774900168,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "f(i,j) = f(i-1,j-v[i]*k)+w[i]*k   (k=0,1,2,3,...)\n\n      = Max( f(i-1,j) , f(i-1,j-v[i]) + w[i] , f(i-1,j-v[i]*2) + w[i]*2 , f(i-1,j-v[i]*3) + w[i]*3 , ... , f(i-1,j-v[i]*k) + w[i]*k , ... )",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
