    {
      "id": "LaE24wAfz2Uy_ZXMafMtH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1323.5799263804158,
      "y": -68.7152010108889,
      "width": 515.9039916992188,
      "height": 59.99999999999996,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1158094120,
      "version": 492,
      "versionNonce": 525051563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765269519745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "由于直接求不好求，我们同时加减去第i个物品的体积不影响最终的最大值\n因此可以先计算前i-1个物品的最大价值，最后再加上第i个物品的价值。\n最终就得到了我们想要求的值",
      "fontSize": 15.99999999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "由于直接求不好求，我们同时加减去第i个物品的体积不影响最终的最大值\n因此可以先计算前i-1个物品的最大价值，最后再加上第i个物品的价值。\n最终就得到了我们想要求的值",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yYc3Eog14Xrjhh6BpEDIC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1326.4000854492188,
      "y": 7.532240321277868,
      "width": 235.4998016357422,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 633545768,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 226045829,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765269595508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "f(i,j) = f(i-1,j-v[i]) + w(i)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "f(i,j) = f(i-1,j-v[i]) + w(i)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zpB3CJIN2GG5lE0ynzBZ6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1317.60009765625,
      "y": 49.30000305175781,
      "width": 502.5599365234375,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 627322968,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 1144903856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765260450338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注：这种情况要求j>=v[i]，也就是此时背包剩余容量可以装下第i个物品",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注：这种情况要求j>=v[i]，也就是此时背包剩余容量可以装下第i个物品",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
