    {
      "id": "PunuJk10OXEZRrZpkcdo9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3.8429570879254698,
      "y": 854.1285291399272,
      "width": 554.0624785423279,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 972306096,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 1304017488,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "kXRJgdXT8bNxhFUiboLDo",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1765261035488,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "有 N种物品和一个容量是 V的背包，每种物品都有无限件可用。\n第 i种物品的体积是 vi，价值是 wi。\n求解将哪些物品装入背包，可使这些物品的总体积不超过背包容量，且总价值最\n大。输出最大价值。\n输入格式：\n第一行两个整数，N，V，用空格隔开，分别表示物品种数和背包容积。\n接下来有 N 行，每行两个整数 vi,wi，用空格隔开，分别表示第 i种物品的体积和价\n值。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "有 N种物品和一个容量是 V的背包，每种物品都有无限件可用。\n第 i种物品的体积是 vi，价值是 wi。\n求解将哪些物品装入背包，可使这些物品的总体积不超过背包容量，且总价值最大。输出最大价值。\n输入格式：\n第一行两个整数，N，V，用空格隔开，分别表示物品种数和背包容积。\n接下来有 N 行，每行两个整数 vi,wi，用空格隔开，分别表示第 i种物品的体积和价值。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fkAQ2FcK3y5z3mn4wY3-g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 982.1571724925723,
      "y": 969.3785825456889,
      "width": 341.85642224119516,
      "height": 30.000038146972656,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2056919216,
      "version": 294,
      "versionNonce": 1894474928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765261941327,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们按照第i个物品选几次来划分",
      "fontSize": 24.000030517578132,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我们按照第i个物品选几次来划分",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dI-CeEguk9T7x56pKDE1a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 505.4238784726133,
      "y": 1261.628374337411,
      "width": 418.2879333496094,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1018050128,
      "version": 542,
      "versionNonce": 705676139,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765270817884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "第i个物品只选1次时，完全背包问题就退化为了0-1背包问题",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "第i个物品只选1次时，完全背包问题就退化为了0-1背包问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4ERFfrPDA05S_qk2XQSrD",
