      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766045514139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果我们的数据范围较大，暴力解法的时间复杂度为O(N^3),那么就会TLE。\n因此我们考虑以下优化思路：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果我们的数据范围较大，暴力解法的时间复杂度为O(N^3),那么就会TLE。\n因此我们考虑以下优化思路：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "STgvfPfPr6RiHw9OKvL-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1079.371590078276,
      "y": 3794.3417318620614,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f5faff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 662940394,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1670081270,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766039442155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们的优化方式首先从动态转移方程入手",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我们的优化方式首先从动态转移方程入手",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ceK4D-xG_08m_kcewZTko",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1074.4461729666018,
      "y": 3815.4113907996357,
      "width": 458.8398742675781,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#f5faff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 743838954,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 1090780138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766039720313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "二进制优化方式：1 2 4 8 ...      O(N)--> 0(logN)\n例如：200 = 1 + 2 + 4 + 8 + 16 + 32 + 64 + 73\n对于73 我们额外考虑处理",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "二进制优化方式：1 2 4 8 ...      O(N)--> 0(logN)\n例如：200 = 1 + 2 + 4 + 8 + 16 + 32 + 64 + 73\n对于73 我们额外考虑处理",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
